WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:07,600
one per person

2
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:09,340
If I call you tomorrow, who will serve?

3
00:00:09,620 --> 00:00:11,300
Six eggs, just enough for six people

4
00:00:11,740 --> 00:00:16,660
Then which one I have is not specified.

5
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:25,680
Who is called? Who will serve the last one? Why?

6
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:28,420
Because you work the least

7
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:33,740
I laid three sticks of firewood and I saw them

8
00:00:39,160 --> 00:00:40,360
You used this trick last time

9
00:00:40,360 --> 00:00:41,400
I won't be fooled again

10
00:00:41,760 --> 00:01:13,770
They were all served to Xiao Tang and kept in the cabinet. I'm going to get the eggs right now.
